e still supporting ongoing strategic investments in marketing and in direct to consumer and omnichannel capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/20/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q3-2017-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2017 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2017-11-17","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"We continue to make progress in DTC with an 11% increase in sales over last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/20/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q3-2017-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2017 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2017-11-17","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"More than 2/3 of our DTC traffic comes from mobile.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/20/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q3-2017-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2017 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2017-11-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joanne Crevoiserat","x":"That has enabled us to take cost out of the business in a number of areas, but also importantly reinvest back in the areas that are important to driving the top line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2017/11/20/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q3-2017-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2018-06-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"Direct to consumer net sales increased 14% compared to last year, with another quarter of growth across both brands and geographies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/01/abercrombie-fitch-company-anf-q1-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2018-06-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"Our direct-to-consumer business also continues to perform strongly, with double digit growth in both the U.S. and international markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/01/abercrombie-fitch-company-anf-q1-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2018-06-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"For the quarter, DTC sales were up 14%, with comp sales up 8%, and accounted for approximately 27% of total sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/01/abercrombie-fitch-company-anf-q1-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2018-06-01","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Susan Anderson","x":"Was it similar to the company average DTC performance?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/01/abercrombie-fitch-company-anf-q1-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2018-06-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joanne Crevoiserat","x":"We have the lease flexibility to make this happen and the tools at our disposal to drive fixed costs down and improve productivity through store closures and right-sizing and expanding our prototype footprint through remodels and new store openings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/01/abercrombie-fitch-company-anf-q1-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2018-06-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Joanne Crevoiserat","x":"In 2018, we plan to deliver 70 engaging new customer experiences through prototypes and remodels while also right-sizing or closing some of our less productive stores.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/06/01/abercrombie-fitch-company-anf-q1-2018-earnings-con.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2018-08-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"In the second quarter, direct-to-consumer net sales increased 16% compared to last year, with another quarter of growth across both brands and geographies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/31/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q2-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2018-08-30","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"Our direct-to-consumer business continued to perform strongly with solid gross -- growth across both brands in the U.S. and international markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/31/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q2-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2018-08-30","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"For the quarter, DTC net sales were up 16% and comp sales were up 11% and were approximately 26% of total sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/31/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q2-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2018-08-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"…focused on following four pillars, optimizing our global store network; enhancing our digital commerce fulfillment and omnichannel capabilities; streamlining our end-to-end concept to customer processes; and optimizing our marketing investments, including leveraging our growing loyalty programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/31/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q2-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2018-08-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"We remain focused on rightsizing our store fleet and adapting to the evolving role of the store as our customers' shopping preferences shift.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/08/31/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q2-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2019-03-06","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"We actually leveraged our shipping and handling expense as part of our DTC business in 2018, so we're pleased with that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/06/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2019-03-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"Before turning to our fourth transformation initiative, I want to quickly touch on China tariff.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/06/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2018 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2019-03-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"Our outlook excludes the impact of any potential future China tariffs on apparel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/03/06/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q4-2018-earnings-conference.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2019-05-29","l":"streaming","r":"analyst","s":"Marni Shapiro","x":"You have 30% direct to consumer; that's where your customers gravitating.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/29/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2019-05-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"The first is the potential tariffs on China stores to apparel.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/29/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2019-05-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"In addition to the China tariffs, we are also closely monitoring the retail landscape.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/29/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2019-05-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"But another one is right-sizing of our store base, a great stat that we'd like to talk about internally is over the last couple of years, we've right-sized or downsized over 30 stores.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/29/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2019-08-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"Before turning to our outlook, I want to provide an update on our flagship strategy as well as our plans for Brexit and an update on China tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/29/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2019-08-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"Last but certainly not least, China tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/29/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2019-08-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"There are several key components to this strategy, including right-sizing, remodeling, opening and closing stores.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/29/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q2-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2019-11-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"While we have been faced unexpected headwinds this year including FX rate, tariff and global protests, we are optimistic that we will finish 2019 on a strong note.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2019-11-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"China tariffs had a negligible impact on Q3 results, as we expect most of this year's impact to flow through in Q4.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2019-11-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Janine Stichter","x":"You mentioned not raising prices this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2019-11-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Janine Stichter","x":"Any thoughts into next year these tariffs, think about the appetite for the consumer to absorb additional price increases?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/11/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q3-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2020-03-04","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"In digital and omni, we grew DTC revenues by double-digits, implemented omnichannel capabilities across key global markets and equipped our store associates with handheld devices to improve shopping and checkout.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/04/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2020-03-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"Over the past few years, we had made great progress, but have also been impacted by some unanticipated external factors, including a strong dollar, China tariffs and protests in key markets across Europe and Asia.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/04/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2020-03-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"This included the adverse impact from changes in FX of 50 basis points and from China tariffs of 30 basis points.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/04/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2020-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"They need to be the right size in the right location and the right economics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/04/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2019 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2020-03-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"Flagships are important piece of our square footage rationalization story, and so is the rightsizing of large format Abercrombie stores in favor to smaller, more productive omni-enabled spaces.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/03/04/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q4-2019-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2020-05-28","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"And then moving onto the last piece here, DTC, what expenses and the curbside.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2020-05-28","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"On DTC specifically, we did see a rise in shipping and handling expense that came along with the sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2020-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"That said we need our stores to be the right size, in the right location, at the right economics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2020-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"So with cost reduction, yeah, we were able to take about $200 million out of our OpEx plans for the year versus where we were coming into the year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/28/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2020-08-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"We still believe that stores matter and they are the important part of the omnichannel brand experience, but they must be the right size, in the right location, with the right economics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/27/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2020-08-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"We love stores, but we have to have the right economics, the right size, and the right locations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/08/27/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2020-11-24","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"Our August denim event drove our highest DTC category day in ANF brand history, while our Fierce day and fleece weekend both drove sales and brand awareness.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/24/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2020-11-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"But as we have said before, they must be the right size in the right location with the right economics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/24/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2020-11-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"In addition, we recognized a pre-tax benefit of approximately $8 million in the current quarter, primarily due to a gain on lease assignment and updates to previously established accruals for asset retirement and severance obligations related to the four early flagship assets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/24/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2021-03-02","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"Reflecting ongoing global uncertainty, we will continue to conservatively manage inventories, optimize our DTC capacity for digital demand, position the business for chase and tightly manage expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2021-03-02","l":"dtc","r":"analyst","s":"Marni Shapiro","x":"And then, could you just also talk about -- I think the Company hit 54%, is that right, DTC for the year?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2021-03-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"This gives us the ongoing ability to refine our base by segmenting, relocating or rightsizing legacy larger format flagships and mall-based locations, while continuing to find the right spaces to provide our customers with exciting and authentically on-brand, new omnichannel experiences.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2020 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2021-03-02","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"With our financial strength and digital penetration, we remain disciplined with our approach and look forward to working with our global landlord partners to find spaces that are the right size, right location and right economics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/03/02/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2021 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"And regarding -- I think the question was full-price selling and taking prices up.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2021 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2021-05-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"So, we are not looking to currently raise our prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2021 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"We look forward to having thoughtful conversations with our landlord partners to find stores that are the right size, right location and right economics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2021 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2021-05-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"We will put some of the cost savings realized in 2020 back to work in customer-facing areas to fuel growth opportunities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q1-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2021 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2021-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"This included: growing our digital channel, which carries a higher four-wall operating margin in stores; rightsizing our store fleet; expanding our digital and technology teams; adding to our vendor and regional carrier networks; and investing in marketing with an emphasis on digital and social.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2021 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2021-08-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Scott Lipesky","x":"We look forward to having thoughtful conversations with our landlord partners to find stores that are the right size in the right location at the right economics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/08/26/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q2-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2021 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2021-11-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"So, I'm very proud, Dana, to tell you that we actually have not raised our prices this year nor do we plan to for the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2021 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2021-11-23","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Dana Telsey","x":"Where are you in terms of raising prices?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/23/abercrombie-fitch-co-anf-q3-2021-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2025-05-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Ball","x":"All of this work will have a clear impact, and based on our current assumptions on tariffs, we are not planning broad-based ticket increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/28/abercrombie-anf-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2025-05-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert Ball","x":"Within that, inventory units are up 6%, so we're positioned to support future growth, along with four percentage points from freight and inventory actions related to tariffs, with year-over-year changes in product category mix driving the remaining cost increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/28/abercrombie-anf-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2025-05-28","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert Ball","x":"For AUR specifically, we are currently assuming no AUR mitigation in our outlook, as we do not anticipate broad-based ticket price increases.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/28/abercrombie-anf-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2025-05-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert Ball","x":"The carryover inventory, you know, we'll still see some AUR pressure here on the A and F side as we work through the balance of that carryover and right-size inventory, and that's a bit of a factor for Q2 as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/05/28/abercrombie-anf-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2025-11-25","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Ball","x":"We've got strong engagement across both stores and DTC platforms here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/abercrombie-anf-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2025-11-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Ball","x":"The 280 basis point decline in operating margin from Q3 2024 was driven primarily by 210 basis points of tariff expense included in the cost of sales.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/abercrombie-anf-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2025-11-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Ball","x":"We continue to reflect tariffs and mitigation, consistent with our second-quarter call commentary, and the team continues to find cost efficiencies through vendor discussions as we plan for 2026.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/abercrombie-anf-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2025-11-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Robert J. Ball","x":"And we've touched on this earlier, but while we haven't moved tickets broadly through the holiday, we are taking targeted price increases here for the spring, so that will start delivering here post-holiday.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/abercrombie-anf-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q3","e":"anf","d":"2025-11-25","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Janet Joseph Kloppenburg","x":"And the price increases, when do you expect those to be complete?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/25/abercrombie-anf-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2026-03-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"With balanced top-line growth and continued financial discipline, we delivered an operating margin of 14.1%, including 360 basis points of tariff pressure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/04/abercrombie-fitch-anf-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2026-03-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"We delivered an operating margin of 13.3%, or 12.5% adjusting for a one-time litigation benefit, a double-digit result for the third straight year, despite 170 basis points of tariff pressure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/04/abercrombie-fitch-anf-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2026-03-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"So first on the ticket prices: we mentioned during our last call that our strategy was to start to see some of these ticket price increases for our spring product.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/04/abercrombie-fitch-anf-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2025 Q4","e":"anf","d":"2026-03-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz","x":"We did not raise prices in key categories like denim and opening price point T-shirts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/03/04/abercrombie-fitch-anf-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2026 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2026-05-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"Third, to continue to invest in tools and technologies, including AI to improve our speed and efficiency across the product and customer journeys.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/abercrombie-anf-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2026 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2026-05-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Mauricio Serna Vega","x":"You mentioned -- you touched upon AI investments that you've done.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/abercrombie-anf-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2026 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2026-05-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"Operating margin of 8% exceeded our plan, reflecting slightly lower tariff rates.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/abercrombie-anf-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2026 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2026-05-27","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"Second, to stabilize gross margins by mitigating external cost pressures, including tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/abercrombie-anf-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2026 Q1","e":"anf","d":"2026-05-27","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"One quarter in, the team continues to stay agile in a dynamic global environment, and 2026 is shaping up to be another year of consistent progress as we maintain our full year outlook on net sales, operating margin and earnings per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/27/abercrombie-anf-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2026 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2026-08-26","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"Third, to continue to invest in tools and technologies, including AI to improve speed and efficiency across the product and customer journeys.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/02/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2026 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2026-08-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"While we benefited from tariff refunds in the quarter we beat our outlook by more than the refund on both operating margin and earnings per share.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/02/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2026 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2026-08-26","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Fran Horowitz-Bonadies","x":"While we benefited from $100 million in tariff refunds, we beat our outlook by more than that on the bottom line, delivering an operating margin of 19.9% and net income per diluted share of $4.17 for the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/09/02/abercrombie-fitch-anf-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ANF 2026 Q2","e":"anf","d":"2026-08-26","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Janet Kloppenburg","x":"On AUR, are you seeing that's coming from less promotions and you did speak to that and also price increases and what the outlook looks like for that going fo